    {
      "name": "LPD Thunder",
      "start_date": "2026-09-09T11:00:00-07:00",
      "end_date": "2026-09-09T13:00:00-07:00",
      "summary": "<p>Get ready to bring on the spirit of battle and Thunder in Cresfirc's Tank battle event, in this setup we will all set up in the world as balanced teams and fight till the end of the event with  YOU GUESSED IT, TANKS , you will be able to expand your strategical knowledge and get to either dominate the fields of battle or set up defensive quarters alongside your friends and other members.</p>\n<p>How will this work out?</p>\n<p>Balanced teams of depending on how many people we will have, you will race on controlling the main objective and the team that controls the interest point will be victorious, if you wish to change your team, please ask the event host or the supervisor.</p>\n<p>REQUIRMENTS TO PARTICIPATE:<br>PLEASE BRING AN OPTIMISED AVATAR (maximum Medium Quality) WITH NO COLLIDERS, IF YOU BRING COLLIDERS IT WILL FLING THE VEHICLES IN THE SKY.</p>\n<p>Who can participate?</p>\n<p>Everyone inside the LPD Discord, the instance will be Group+ and you are encouraged to bring out your friends for a more fulfilling experience.</p>",
      "categories": [
        "Off Duty Events"
      ],
      "host": "Cresfirc",
      "timezone": "Europe/Lisbon"
    },
